=== width 80, no colour ===
Inline <span class="x">tags</span> are shown as <em>the text they are</em>, and
so are <!-- comments -->, but a tag
that breaks the line does.

  <div align="center">
    <b>An HTML block</b> is *not* parsed.
  </div>

  <details>
  <summary>Summary</summary>

Markdown between the tags is.

  </details>

  <!--
  a comment
  over several lines
  -->
